# Trivy vulnerability exceptions for the kwatch image.
#
# Every entry is a temporary risk decision recorded under
# docs/vulnerability-exceptions.md: it needs a reviewed issue or advisory,
# an owner, and an expiry no more than 90 days out. Write the expiry on the
# entry itself so Trivy stops honouring it automatically:
#
#   # <issue URL> - <component> - <reason> - owner @<handle>
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# Unfixed findings in the base OS packages are already excluded by the
# scanner invocation (--ignore-unfixed on the os package scan); Go module
# findings are never auto-excluded and need an entry here.
#
# No exceptions are active.
